---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Zenix.">
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 mb-8">Last updated: May 24, 2026</p>

        <h2>Data Controller</h2>
        <p>
          <pre>
Name:        Hypernova Oy
Business ID: 2925676-3
Address:     PL 16, 80101
             Joensuu, Finland
Email:       privacypolicy@hypernova.fi</pre>
        </p>

        <p>This privacy policy will explain how our organization uses the data we collect from this www.hypernova.fi website.</p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We only collect information about you if we have a reason to do so, for example, to provide our Services, to communicate with you, or to make our Services better.</p>
        <p>The information we collect includes</p>
        <ul>
          <li>IP address</li>
          <li>The pages you have visited on this website</li>
          <li>The content you have entered into a contact form</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to provide, maintain, and improve our services.</p>
        <p>We analyze website traffic using Matomo.</p>
        <p>We use the information you have entered into a contact form to respond back to your request.</p>

        <h2>3. Sharing Information</h2>
        <p>Data is located in Hetzner Finland Oy datacenter in Helsinki, Finland.</p>
        <p>We do not share your personal information with companies, organizations, or individuals outside us and our datacenter except in the following cases: with your consent or for legal reasons.</p>
        <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We work hard to protect our users from unauthorized access to or unauthorized alteration, disclosure or destruction of information we hold.</p>
        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>GDPR applies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
